WEBVTT

NOTE showcase: written VO text from episode.json, timed from the timeline VO placements

vo-b1-hook-1
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:15.218
In IntelliDash, Spatial Adjust
turns the latest moisture

vo-b1-hook-2
00:00:15.318 --> 00:00:18.460
scan into a percent adjustment,
station by station.

vo-b2-measure-1
00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:26.098
Each station's average VWC comes
from a TurfRad moisture scan,

vo-b2-measure-2
00:00:26.198 --> 00:00:28.370
dated beside the station name.

vo-b3-see-1
00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:38.508
The map colours pins by measured
moisture. Move the bands, or switch to

vo-b3-see-2
00:00:38.608 --> 00:00:43.680
variance to see each station against
its target. Map and table stay in sync.

vo-b4-target-1
00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:51.562
You set the target: the moisture
you want each station to hold.

vo-b4-target-2
00:00:51.662 --> 00:00:54.300
A soil factor handles persistent offsets.

vo-b5-calculate-1
00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:02.296
The gap between target and measured
becomes water, today's ET is added,

vo-b5-calculate-2
00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:07.220
Daily Max Amount caps it, and the result
becomes a suggested percent adjust.

vo-b5-threshold-1
00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:08.970
Below a minimum threshold,

vo-b5-threshold-2
00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:12.590
a suggestion is zeroed or lifted
to the threshold when you push.

vo-b6-review-1
00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:21.794
Before you push, override any suggestion,
replace or shift targets in bulk,

vo-b6-review-2
00:01:21.894 --> 00:01:27.250
find the outliers at both ends, or take
a station or hole out of adjustment.

vo-b7-push-1
00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:34.689
Nothing changes until you
push. Review the two lists,

vo-b7-push-2
00:01:34.789 --> 00:01:37.774
untick anything you're
unsure of, and send.

vo-b7-push-3
00:01:37.874 --> 00:01:43.220
Spatial Adjust writes each station,
then reads Lynx back and checks each one.

vo-b7-lynx-1
00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.736
Lynx itself must be set up
to match Spatial Adjust;

vo-b7-lynx-2
00:01:46.836 --> 00:01:48.820
the push guide lists the settings.

vo-b8-close-1
00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:53.580
Target minus measured, station by
station. That is the whole idea.
